[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11594.07, "timestamp": "03:13:14", "text": "该死的。我无法选择任何人。按 F。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11595.83, "timestamp": "03:13:15", "text": "好了，走吧。点兵点将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11608.79, "timestamp": "03:13:28", "text": "我们走吧。所以我想我选择的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11611.349, "timestamp": "03:13:31", "text": "名单上的名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11616.71, "timestamp": "03:13:36", "text": "好的。我希望大家都知道怎么玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11619.91, "timestamp": "03:13:39", "text": "这款游戏。呃，我是新来的。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11623.11, "timestamp": "03:13:43", "text": "第一次。给我打电话。我是第一次来。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11624.95, "timestamp": "03:13:44", "text": "可以像第一次那样给我打电话，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11627.03, "timestamp": "03:13:47", "text": "我其实从来没玩过这个游戏。会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11629.59, "timestamp": "03:13:49", "text": "你喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11632.87, "timestamp": "03:13:52", "text": "《Among Us》里有角色扮演功能吗？是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11634.15, "timestamp": "03:13:54", "text": "我们将从他开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11638.87, "timestamp": "03:13:58", "text": "兄弟，他要把我们都揍趴下。好的。嗯？"}]